WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.960
Allah chose Isa and gave him the power to perform miracles.

2
00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:07.048
Isa shaped little birds out of clay.

3
00:00:07.448 --> 00:00:13.496
He breathed into them, and in the holy light the birds became real, flying up into the sky.

4
00:00:13.896 --> 00:00:17.904
Isa prayed for the sick, and in the holy light they were healed.

5
00:00:18.304 --> 00:00:23.416
The disciples asked for a feast to be sent down from heaven, so Isa prayed to Allah.

6
00:00:23.816 --> 00:00:27.416
And down from the sky came a table spread with food.

7
00:00:27.816 --> 00:00:35.208
Allah raised Isa up to Himself. Isa is Allah's servant and messenger, and every miracle happened only by Allah's permission.
